# Generated by `idf.py set-target` from sdkconfig.defaults plus the per-chip
# sdkconfig.defaults.<target> fragment and, at CONSOLE=1, sdkconfig.console.
# Not committed: they are derived, they are rewritten on every set-target, and
# tracking them would let the effective configuration drift from the defaults
# files that are the actual source.
#
# The glob covers sdkconfig.<target> and every suffixed variant
# (-console, -uart0). It does not match sdkconfig.defaults.esp32c6 and friends,
# which stay tracked.
sdkconfig.esp32*
sdkconfig.*.old

# The repo-root .gitignore already covers build/, which is ~180MB here.
